I dispise the idea of a funeral. I would rather if everyone moved on, I am planning to self-isolate for long enough to make the remaining connections so weak that it would be a blip on the radar, and nothing more. This idea seems to justify the suicide anyways, as it reinforces the collapsing self-esteem. I am not meant to live. The suicide note is simple, just want this death to be of little trouble and / or consequence as possible. There is no need for any system to change, for this was just delayed for 15 years. I should die. I should just do it somehow, with some sort of finality. I am not happy.
